  "api_changes": [
    "TextControllerWorkspace.filter is TextFilterWorkspace: Exact(&TokenFilter) or OptionalMask{max_mask_positions,mask_capacity_bytes}. From<&TokenFilter> preserves exact callers.",
    "TextControllerContract explicitly distinguishes exact All, exact Allowed and optional filtering; uses_mask means may use, requires_mask means every decision requires a mask.",
    "WorkspaceSamplingOperation::OptionalTokenFilter requires complete masked costs and the input-alias alternative.",
    "quote_sampling_workspace accepts WorkspaceSamplingInput with logical layout and optional actual backing-capacity envelope. Bare layouts explicitly declare packed capacity; architecture passes actual score backing facts."
  ],
  "behavior": [
    "Cold optional declarations validate mask geometry and host capacity without constructing bits. Decision checks preserve executable membership, final extent/capacity, original-mask overlap and shared provenance.",
    "TokenChoiceController quotes All sources without callbacks or synthetic masks, preserves exact Allowed behavior and composes nested optional domain/capacity bounds with replacement overlap.",
    "The existing configured sampler executes every quote step. Optional filtering preserves possible allocation and input alias roots, including all earlier delivered token/key roots across mixed schedules.",
    "Optional mask payload and primitive costs occur only when outputs are possible; independent RNG initialization and existing controller payload remain. Missing required native or host facts stay unknown.",
    "Architecture gathers the maximum complete reachable backing union of actual score rows. Sampling supplies distinct score identities per step so escaped earlier aliases retain real capacity. The envelope is conservative and grants no residual credit.",
    "Actual MLX sampling execution is unchanged. Native facts reuse ordinary filter costs with both output-storage alternatives.",
    "Pre-staged forced choices run then continue unfiltered under the same policy; post-preparation controller mutation still fails identity checks before further controller/native work."
  ],
